IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gp-dates`
IMPORT `gp-part4a`

-- Supreme Court Act 1986 (Vic), Part 4A -- the questions of the REPRESENTATIVE PLAINTIFF.
--
-- SEAT: the person with a claim who brings, or has brought, a group proceeding on behalf of others (the "plaintiff" of
-- s 33A; also a person substituted as plaintiff). A second seat beside the group member's (gp-seat.l4), drawing on the same
-- rules in gp-part4a.l4 so the two cannot disagree: "Can I bring a group proceeding for us all?", "May I go on if my own
-- claim ends?", "Can I be ordered to pay the defendant's costs?", "May the Court make a group costs order on my
-- application?", "May I settle my own claim, and stop being plaintiff?", "Can I recover my unrecovered costs from the
-- damages?", "May I go on alone if the proceeding stops being a group proceeding?". The Court and the defendant get no seat.
--
